{"id": 88813, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Warlord Krellianの首をAzsharaにいるCommander Truesongのところへ持って行ってください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-r70888-qo-sg12@2026-11-12", "imported": "2026-11-12"}, "english": {"hash": "dc00b1b5a5fff225", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70888"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 88813, "field": "description", "ja": "最後の標的はSpitelashの首領、Warlord Krellianだ。奴はEldarathの廃墟にあるTemple of Zin-Malorで、護衛の陰に隠れて怯えている。\n\nKrelianの首を斬り落とせば、手下どもは恐れをなして海へ這い戻っていくだろう。そうすれば、ついにAzsharaは再びKaldoreiのものとなる。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "source": "draft-r70888-qd-sg12@2026-11-12", "imported": "2026-11-12"}, "english": {"hash": "90c557e5780c65fa", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70888"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
